The WDC blockers need more precise wording. The main altoffset probe already computes `ok`, so connecting that verdict to exit status is one line. Addtoinbuf can also make row failures affect its exit status with one line, though gate readiness still needs apparatus validation, a fixed-leg mode, and prepared media. The signature and 4-bit companions already accept a single tagged binary.

The signature probe needs an exact fixed-value test: its current “not the signature” branch also accepts missing values. I also confirmed the separate `fbpending_bound` deadline and the updated LCA manifest entry that keeps a detector-shaped probe outside dated wiring debt.
