The static checks are complete. The sketches pin hpcmips to `28/28` and fbpending to its 11 controls, cap `762`, and exact PASS verdict. I’ve placed fbpending after all LUNA work and tied each WDC re-date to a named implementation and verification milestone.

Two broader debts remain: `fbpending_bound` still first fails on September 21, and the LCA probe now has 12 rows while its witness classification still shields it from wiring enforcement. Runtime costs and both mutant/HEAD control pairs still need measurement in the later verification round.
